      "statement": "Tool input validation is built on Pydantic models where args_schema can be explicitly provided as a Pydantic BaseModel or JSON schema dict, or automatically inferred from the _run() method signature via create_schema_from_function(), with injected arguments (InjectedToolArg, InjectedToolCallId, ToolRuntime) automatically excluded from the schema sent to models but re-injected at runtime during execution.",
