      "statement": "Injected arguments are identified and tracked via _get_injected_args_keys_from_signature() which resolves type annotations with support for postponed annotations (from __future__ import annotations, quoted forward references) and checks annotations against _is_injected_arg_type() which detects both Annotated[T, InjectedToolArg] patterns and directly injected types like ToolRuntime.",
