      "statement": "Tool output formatting via _format_output() returns ToolOutputMixin instances or lists thereof unchanged, returns non-ToolMessage content unchanged if tool_call_id is None (not part of agentic flow), otherwise normalizes content to string or list of message content blocks and wraps in ToolMessage with status indicating success or error.",
