      "id": "claim_ff67a78cfef34fd7aa97854dacd32f8e",
      "statement": "Injected arguments are identified through _get_injected_args_keys_from_signature() which resolves postponed annotations (from __future__ import annotations, quoted forward references) using get_type_hints with per-parameter fallback retry so unresolvable forward references don't disable injection for resolvable parameters, and checks annotations against _is_injected_arg_type() which detects both Annotated[T, InjectedToolArg] patterns and directly injected types like ToolRuntime.",
