    {
      "id": "claim_85d71dbd4a734e3fbfe90ce78e485224",
      "statement": "Tool is a single-input tool that enforces exactly one argument, defaulting to {\"tool_input\": {\"type\": \"string\"}} schema when args_schema is None, used for simple function wrappers and backward compatibility; StructuredTool supports multiple arguments with explicit schema-driven parsing where each function parameter becomes a schema field (except injected args), supporting both sync (func) and async (coroutine) invocation, and is preferred for agent tools with multiple named parameters.",
